# File naming

All **file and folder names** in this repo use underscores (`_`), never hyphens (`-`).

## Rules

- Separate words with `_`: `vero_landing.html`, `impact_metrics.md`, `case_studies/`
- Spell **datumlabs** as one word — no dash, no underscore: `datumlabs.md`, `datumlabs.html`, not `datum-labs` or `datum_labs`
- When renaming, update every reference (README, scripts, HTML `href`s, cross-links)

## Examples

| Bad | Good |
|-----|------|
| `datum-labs.md` | `datumlabs.md` |
| `datum-labs-no-cases.html` | `datumlabs_no_cases.html` |
| `case-studies/` | `case_studies/` |
| `vero-landing.html` | `vero_landing.html` |
| `inputs-questionnaire.md` | `inputs_questionnaire.md` |
| `casestudy-ai-voice-agent.html` | `casestudy_ai_voice_agent.html` |

Display text and URLs (e.g. `datumlabs.io/vero`) are unchanged — this rule applies to repo paths only.
